    "summary": "In [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), the bearer's unit can regain as many as 3 **destroyed** models, or as many as D3+3 instead while it is in an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)'s range and you control that marker. This cannot bring back a destroyed **CHARACTER** model of an [Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units), and a returned model's **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapons that it shot before it was destroyed still count as shot.",
